          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "TRING                 AKEMAN STREET SP 9211                                         (East side) 11/38                                   Nos. 16, and 17 - GV                                      II 3 houses, now 2 houses. Early C19. Red brick with gauged red brick arches and slate roof hipped to N end. A block of 3 small houses, facing W, the front of the N house at a slight angle due to bend in road. 2 storeys and cellar. 3 windows to each floor and 3 doors. N house has recessed sash window to 1st floor with 8/8 panes and flat gauged arch, plank door and 6/6 sash both with timber lintels. Other 2 houses each have similar 1st floor window, a triple-sash window below and door to right, both with flat gauged arches. Little altered example. Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP9235811249"
    }
  ],
